// Membership is decided by two Unicode properties together, Assigned AND Emoji,
// tested on the whole codepoint (ch[0] of a surrogate pair is only the high
// surrogate and matches nothing). That pair is what excludes the two kinds of
// junk that otherwise slip in: unassigned codepoints inside ranges reserved for
// future emoji, which draw as tofu boxes, and assigned-but-not-emoji pictographs
// such as the alchemical symbols block.
//
// Every entry is additionally checked against classifyAlias and kept only if it
// classifies as single_emoji, so the picker can never offer a symbol the server
// would then refuse.

